/home/epentland/ai/canopy/guardian-zig/FEEDBACK.md:5119:- **good:** Guardian passed all 71 whole-tree checks while the EDA build policy was made explicit across 20 documentation, configuration-help, hook, and service files: every internal artifact now stays self-hosted Debug, and LLVM ReleaseSafe is confined to deployment. Exact-commit release preparation completed the 2,538-test Debug job in 75 seconds and the sole ReleaseSafe build in 284 seconds (291 seconds concurrent wall), then the merge hook reused that candidate and passed every production health probe.
