/home/epentland/ai/canopy/guardian-zig/FEEDBACK.md:10991:- **friction:** After Guardian, full tests, and ReleaseSafe build passed, the unrelated Barracuda timing probe failed five Canvas thresholds (31.5–33.3 ms medians; 53.8–58 ms p95/max). The unchanged retained binary immediately passed a locked retry at 19.4–20.6 ms medians and 31.7–31.9 ms p95/max, but official certification required a second 172-second release wrapper run. A bounded isolated retry for a timing-only failure would remove this recurring host-jitter cost without weakening the fail-closed code/test gates.
